<title>CANADA: Stampeder sees C$140 mln from Viking sale.</title>
<headline>Stampeder sees C$140 mln from Viking sale.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stampeder Exploration Ltd said it expects to receive net proceeds of C$140 for its sale of a royalty and related assets of Viking Energy Royalty Trust and Viking Acquisitions Ltd.</p>
<p>The Calgary-based oil and gas company said the closing date of the sale will be December 18, 1996.</p>
<p>(Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
